sequenceDiagram
    participant B as Browser
    participant S as Next server
    participant D as Data source
    B->>S: GET /dashboard
    S-->>B: HTML shell + fallback (Suspense)
    S->>D: fetch slow data
    Note over B: Shows shell, loads JS
    D-->>S: data
    S-->>B: RSC chunk + inline script
    Note over B: React swaps fallback for content
    Note over B: Hydrate Client Components
